cc-orq
Copyright (c) 2026 Giovanni Correa

cc-orq reimplements, for Claude Code, the orchestrator surface of T3 Code
(https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code). The tool surface (delegate a task, read
its status, cancel it, list capabilities), the task status vocabulary and the
privilege ceiling between a parent and its child tasks follow T3 Code's
"Orchestrator V2" design. Two parts are adapted from T3 Code's source:

- hooks/contract.ts: the shapes of the orchestrator contract
  (packages/contracts/src/orchestratorMcp.ts), reduced to what cc-orq uses.
- hooks/instructions.ts and instructions.md: the orchestration instructions
  given to the parent agent, rewritten for cc-orq's tools.

